OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy for
OL,6,Fmuch of the night with a band of rain,
OL,7,Fheavy at times, slowly moving
OL,8,Fsoutheastwards. Becoming drier by dawn
OL,9,Fwith an easing wind and some clear
OL,10,Fspells developing into Friday morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA cool start to the morning
OL,13,Funder clear skies. Becoming cloudier
OL,14,Fwith the chance of some showers
OL,15,Fdeveloping during the afternoon,
OL,16,Fmainly over high ground and along the
OL,17,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
